<article class="cm-prose">
  <span class="cm-eyebrow">{{t "common.legalEyebrow"}}</span>
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

  <p class="cm-legal-note">
    This is a convenience translation of our <a href="/de/datenschutz" hreflang="de" lang="de">Datenschutzerklärung</a>.
    Only the German version is legally binding.
  </p>

  <h2>1. Controller</h2>
  <p>The controller responsible for data processing under the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) is:</p>
  <address>
    Rocket Pad Platforms GmbH<br />
    Wallstr. 16, 40878 Ratingen, Germany<br />
    Email: <a href="mailto:management@rocketpadplatforms.de">management@rocketpadplatforms.de</a>
  </address>

  <h2>2. General information on data processing</h2>
  <p>
    In operating our business and this website, we only process the data required to provide the content. No data
    is passed on to third parties or processed outside Germany.
  </p>

  <h2>3. Data processing</h2>
  <p>
    We only collect and store personal data where this is technically necessary to provide our services
    successfully. This includes temporarily storing information about requests to our web servers in order to
    prevent attacks on our systems through overload. No personal data is collected for analytics purposes.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Language selection</h2>
  <p>
    If you open our homepage without choosing a language, we redirect you to the German or English version based on
    the preferred language your browser sends (Accept-Language). This information is evaluated for the redirect only
    and is not stored.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Fonts</h2>
  <p>
    The fonts used on this website are served from our own servers. No connection is made to third-party servers —
    in particular not to Google Fonts — so your IP address is not transmitted to third parties.
  </p>

  <h2>6. Contacting us</h2>
  <p>
    You can contact us by email. When you write to us, we process and store the information you send in order to
    answer your enquiry and to be able to reach you.
  </p>

  <h2>7. RPP Composer</h2>
  <p>
    The RPP Composer is served from our own server; on the homepage it is only loaded after you explicitly click to
    start it. No connection to third parties is made. The configuration you put together in the composer is
    processed exclusively in your browser and is not transmitted to us.
  </p>

  <h2>8. Cookies</h2>
  <p>Our website does not need cookies, so we do not set any first-party cookies.</p>

  <h2>9. Exercising your rights</h2>
  <p>
    If you have questions about the processing of your personal data, or wish to request access, rectification,
    restriction, objection, erasure or the transfer of your data to another company, please contact
    <a href="mailto:management@rocketpadplatforms.de">management@rocketpadplatforms.de</a>.
  </p>

  <p><a class="cm-btn ghost cm-back" href="{{homePath}}">{{t "common.backHome"}}</a></p>
</article>
